1
00:00:01,600 --> 00:00:03,200
ALL DEPICTED EVENTS ARE FICTIONAL

2
00:00:03,280 --> 00:00:06,400
AND FOR ENTERTAINMENT PURPOSES ONLY.
VIEWER DISCRETION IS ADVISED.

3
00:00:19,560 --> 00:00:20,840
<i>After all,</i>

4
00:00:20,920 --> 00:00:25,320
we shall soon be family.

5
00:00:27,320 --> 00:00:28,880
<i>He's about to get married.</i>

6
00:00:28,960 --> 00:00:31,800
<i>Complete the mission and return home.</i>

7
00:00:32,520 --> 00:00:34,720
<i>Better quit the game</i>
<i>before it starts, Nakhun!</i>

8
00:00:48,800 --> 00:00:50,200
My Lord,

9
00:00:50,280 --> 00:00:51,840
what flower might this be?

10
00:00:55,360 --> 00:00:56,880
My Lord…

11
00:01:01,200 --> 00:01:02,800
Master Klao.

12
00:01:02,880 --> 00:01:03,800
Come now, Master.

13
00:01:03,880 --> 00:01:05,960
Playing hide-and-seek is a child's game.

14
00:01:08,160 --> 00:01:11,200
What are you gazing at so intently?

15
00:01:13,720 --> 00:01:14,560
Come on!

16
00:01:24,480 --> 00:01:25,440
Is that…

17
00:01:29,960 --> 00:01:31,840
Meow.

18
00:01:34,920 --> 00:01:36,040
A grumpy cat.

19
00:01:37,880 --> 00:01:39,280
A cat?

20
00:01:39,360 --> 00:01:42,440
Does your manor also house a cat, my Lord?

21
00:01:44,080 --> 00:01:47,000
Indeed, a Khao Manee cat,

22
00:01:47,520 --> 00:01:49,200
pure white from head to tail.

23
00:01:50,200 --> 00:01:52,040
It is at times quite affectionate,

24
00:01:52,800 --> 00:01:54,400
yet at others remarkably playful.

25
00:01:59,080 --> 00:02:01,960
<i>Why am I so emotional and jealous of her?</i>

26
00:02:02,040 --> 00:02:06,720
<i>He doesn't like me. He likes Klao.</i>
<i>I can't afford to fall for him.</i>

27
00:02:09,320 --> 00:02:13,160
<i>Although back at the temple,</i>
<i>Klao's story really resonated with me.</i>

28
00:02:13,240 --> 00:02:15,720
<i>I cried when the fortune teller</i>
<i>mentioned his spirit.</i>

29
00:02:15,800 --> 00:02:18,800
<i>So what's going on?</i>

30
00:02:18,880 --> 00:02:20,520
Let us be on our way, Lady Varna.

31
00:02:20,600 --> 00:02:23,560
I fear High Lord Soontrapinit
has waited in vain.

32
00:02:24,880 --> 00:02:26,040
Yes, my Lord.

33
00:02:44,840 --> 00:02:45,800
Master.

34
00:02:46,680 --> 00:02:48,000
What?

35
00:02:48,080 --> 00:02:49,720
May we set forth now?

36
00:02:49,800 --> 00:02:51,360
Why?

37
00:03:00,480 --> 00:03:01,840
What seems to be the matter?

38
00:03:09,480 --> 00:03:12,760
Up, down, up, down, up, and down.

39
00:03:12,840 --> 00:03:14,120
Allow me to demonstrate.

40
00:04:58,200 --> 00:04:59,680
Lady Varna

41
00:04:59,760 --> 00:05:01,880
possesses grace and refined conduct.

42
00:05:01,960 --> 00:05:03,280
The very essence of a lady.

43
00:05:03,920 --> 00:05:06,040
She is most suited for Phop.

44
00:05:06,120 --> 00:05:07,400
Father.

45
00:05:13,320 --> 00:05:14,800
What about you, Dear Klao?

46
00:05:15,560 --> 00:05:18,040
Have you set your sights upon any lady?

47
00:05:19,360 --> 00:05:22,360
Well, I…

48
00:05:22,440 --> 00:05:24,480
I…

49
00:05:24,560 --> 00:05:26,520
Answer when an elder inquires.

50
00:05:27,280 --> 00:05:28,600
Do not make her wait.

51
00:05:31,400 --> 00:05:33,960
No, I have not.

52
00:05:35,280 --> 00:05:38,080
Then you must hasten to do so.

53
00:05:38,160 --> 00:05:41,560
See to it that you are properly wed
without further delay

54
00:05:41,640 --> 00:05:43,400
before committing to royal service.

55
00:05:43,480 --> 00:05:45,440
Only then shall you be a credible man.

56
00:05:45,520 --> 00:05:49,000
Royal service?

57
00:05:49,080 --> 00:05:50,560
What?

58
00:05:52,000 --> 00:05:55,640
You spoke to me of your desire to enter
royal service, as your father did.

59
00:05:55,720 --> 00:05:58,080
Now that you are fully recovered,

60
00:05:58,160 --> 00:06:00,560
return to your studies
with renewed diligence.

61
00:06:00,640 --> 00:06:03,440
I shall arrange for a master
to guide your studies.

62
00:06:09,040 --> 00:06:11,320
I can guide him, Father.

63
00:06:13,040 --> 00:06:16,040
<i>You are crazy! Why say such a thing?</i>

64
00:06:18,600 --> 00:06:19,600
Very well.

65
00:06:20,720 --> 00:06:23,480
At 20, he has long since come of age.

66
00:06:24,240 --> 00:06:27,040
He can no longer idle his time away.

67
00:06:28,680 --> 00:06:33,960
I entrust you to guide Dear Klao
in all that he ought to know.

68
00:06:35,520 --> 00:06:36,480
Understood, Father.

69
00:07:03,680 --> 00:07:05,880
<i>Committing to royal service</i>
<i>like Klao's father?</i>

70
00:07:23,040 --> 00:07:26,400
<i>Why didn't Phop object to his father</i>
<i>about Klao's marriage,</i>

71
00:07:28,000 --> 00:07:30,920
<i>even though he seems into Klao?</i>

72
00:07:46,560 --> 00:07:48,000
<i>Maybe…</i>

73
00:07:49,640 --> 00:07:51,000
<i>Bromance?</i>

74
00:07:52,680 --> 00:07:53,920
<i>Or…</i>

75
00:07:56,760 --> 00:07:58,240
<i>He hasn't realized it?</i>

76
00:08:02,200 --> 00:08:03,320
<i>Or…</i>

77
00:08:04,840 --> 00:08:06,880
<i>He's bisexual?</i>

78
00:08:09,480 --> 00:08:10,600
<i>Or…</i>

79
00:08:14,200 --> 00:08:16,280
<i>He hasn't come out yet?</i>

80
00:08:21,520 --> 00:08:23,440
Why have you not sought the study hall?

81
00:08:25,480 --> 00:08:27,400
I brought you these books.

82
00:08:30,640 --> 00:08:32,080
What were you writing?

83
00:08:33,400 --> 00:08:35,200
Hey, hey!

84
00:08:36,000 --> 00:08:37,720
Can you not? This is private!

85
00:08:37,799 --> 00:08:39,919
Have I become a stranger to you?

86
00:08:40,760 --> 00:08:42,559
Am I not being clear? I said no!

87
00:09:27,280 --> 00:09:29,680
Why do you turn away from me?

88
00:09:32,600 --> 00:09:34,480
Has Varna troubled your heart?

89
00:09:37,400 --> 00:09:38,800
Not at all.

90
00:09:38,880 --> 00:09:41,080
If so, then what brought you
to the garden,

91
00:09:43,080 --> 00:09:44,560
Grumpy Cat?

92
00:09:50,240 --> 00:09:52,560
I was out for a walk,

93
00:09:52,640 --> 00:09:54,600
stretching as I went.

94
00:09:55,200 --> 00:09:56,640
Why?

95
00:09:57,680 --> 00:09:58,640
Are there rules

96
00:09:58,720 --> 00:10:00,120
in this manor that say

97
00:10:00,200 --> 00:10:01,960
I'm not allowed to take a walk?

98
00:10:04,000 --> 00:10:04,920
Let it be so.

99
00:10:05,840 --> 00:10:07,320
I shall take your word for it.

100
00:10:08,640 --> 00:10:10,240
Let us now study.

101
00:10:25,160 --> 00:10:26,960
<i>I can't read any of this.</i>

102
00:10:50,640 --> 00:10:51,640
I think…

103
00:10:53,560 --> 00:10:57,040
Phop, can we learn something else first?

104
00:11:15,240 --> 00:11:16,960
Is this what you wish to learn?

105
00:11:17,280 --> 00:11:18,120
How odd.

106
00:11:19,360 --> 00:11:21,440
You once rowed with great speed.

107
00:11:22,600 --> 00:11:24,120
Things I once did.

108
00:11:24,200 --> 00:11:26,360
Things aren't the same anymore, are they?

109
00:11:26,880 --> 00:11:29,480
<i>This isn't the same person, you know?</i>

110
00:11:55,440 --> 00:11:57,960
Deep and steady.

111
00:12:02,960 --> 00:12:04,840
Then lift it upward.

112
00:12:06,640 --> 00:12:08,080
Do not skim the surface.

113
00:12:13,160 --> 00:12:15,400
Remember to alternate your strokes.

114
00:12:34,640 --> 00:12:36,520
That's enough. I can row it myself.

115
00:12:38,440 --> 00:12:39,720
You asked for my help.

116
00:12:41,280 --> 00:12:43,400
Yes, but you should let me try it myself.

117
00:12:43,480 --> 00:12:45,160
It's the mark of a good teacher.

118
00:12:48,320 --> 00:12:51,200
-Hey! Let go!
-Klao, be still,

119
00:12:51,280 --> 00:12:54,120
-lest you capsize the boat.
-Then hands off!

120
00:12:55,560 --> 00:12:56,400
Hey.

121
00:12:59,200 --> 00:13:00,400
Hey!

122
00:13:00,480 --> 00:13:02,560
Let go! Let it go!

123
00:13:03,240 --> 00:13:04,160
Hands off. Come on.

124
00:13:04,240 --> 00:13:05,600
Be still, Klao!

125
00:13:20,760 --> 00:13:21,760
Phop?

126
00:13:23,720 --> 00:13:24,720
Phop…

127
00:13:27,440 --> 00:13:28,440
Phop?

128
00:13:30,640 --> 00:13:31,600
Phop.

129
00:13:32,680 --> 00:13:34,800
Phop, don't do this.

130
00:13:35,680 --> 00:13:37,200
This isn't funny.

131
00:13:44,000 --> 00:13:45,160
Phop…

132
00:13:45,240 --> 00:13:46,440
Phop.

133
00:13:46,520 --> 00:13:48,480
Phop! Phop!

134
00:13:49,080 --> 00:13:50,120
Phop!

135
00:13:51,000 --> 00:13:52,160
Phop!

136
00:14:08,080 --> 00:14:12,200
<i>Phop, come on.</i>
<i>Tell me you're gonna be fine.</i>

137
00:14:17,240 --> 00:14:20,040
<i>Where are you? Phop!</i>

138
00:14:27,640 --> 00:14:28,640
Phop?

139
00:14:29,400 --> 00:14:31,200
Where are you?

140
00:14:31,280 --> 00:14:32,280
Phop!

141
00:14:33,880 --> 00:14:34,720
Phop!

142
00:14:34,800 --> 00:14:35,920
I am right here.

143
00:14:38,280 --> 00:14:39,280
Phop!

144
00:14:51,440 --> 00:14:52,440
Phop!

145
00:15:00,720 --> 00:15:02,160
I am more than pleased.

146
00:15:06,320 --> 00:15:08,240
Why are you pleased?

147
00:15:08,880 --> 00:15:10,000
You…

148
00:15:10,080 --> 00:15:11,520
Were you pulling my leg?

149
00:15:13,040 --> 00:15:14,960
I was worried sick about you!

150
00:15:16,880 --> 00:15:18,280
That is why I am pleased.

151
00:15:20,000 --> 00:15:22,280
My concern for you is not unrequited.

152
00:15:50,200 --> 00:15:55,920
<i>If I can't beat this feeling,</i>
<i>why not just embrace it?</i>

153
00:16:15,520 --> 00:16:16,400
Swoosh!

154
00:16:20,400 --> 00:16:22,520
<i>Did people in the past sword fight</i>

155
00:16:22,600 --> 00:16:24,960
<i>like how we go to the gym</i>
<i>or exercise in the park?</i>

156
00:16:36,640 --> 00:16:37,560
Klao,

157
00:16:39,080 --> 00:16:40,720
come enjoy this with me.

158
00:16:42,080 --> 00:16:43,680
Kaew? You're here too?

159
00:16:43,760 --> 00:16:46,400
You like watching sword fighting?

160
00:16:47,080 --> 00:16:48,120
Not quite.

161
00:16:48,200 --> 00:16:50,760
I am merely here out of concern for Jom.

162
00:16:52,560 --> 00:16:53,960
-Ha!
-Ha!

163
00:17:21,720 --> 00:17:23,000
Alas,

164
00:17:23,760 --> 00:17:24,640
you're bleeding.

165
00:17:40,520 --> 00:17:42,280
Step back. Leave me be.

166
00:17:49,280 --> 00:17:50,880
He never ceases to reprimand me.

167
00:17:56,480 --> 00:17:57,800
Well, Thee is…

168
00:17:58,360 --> 00:18:00,600
I mean, the physician
is worried about you, Pun.

169
00:18:01,960 --> 00:18:03,800
I mean, Kaew.

170
00:18:04,480 --> 00:18:07,200
You might get hurt while they're sparring.

171
00:18:08,560 --> 00:18:10,160
How would you know, Klao?

172
00:18:10,840 --> 00:18:12,680
Such is his way.

173
00:18:13,760 --> 00:18:17,440
Whenever I try to draw close to Jom,
he invariably pushes me away.

174
00:18:20,320 --> 00:18:21,400
You guys are the same.

175
00:18:25,560 --> 00:18:27,440
I have friends in Phichit.

176
00:18:28,160 --> 00:18:30,160
They are similar to you…

177
00:18:30,240 --> 00:18:32,360
and the physician.

178
00:18:34,360 --> 00:18:36,480
The closer one gets,

179
00:18:37,280 --> 00:18:39,560
the further the other pulls away.

180
00:18:42,480 --> 00:18:43,720
A bilabial stop

181
00:18:43,800 --> 00:18:46,440
is a sound produced by blocking
airflow with both lips,

182
00:18:46,520 --> 00:18:48,760
such as… and…

183
00:18:49,640 --> 00:18:51,160
That's correct.

184
00:18:51,640 --> 00:18:52,480
And…

185
00:18:52,560 --> 00:18:53,920
this sound?

186
00:18:55,040 --> 00:18:56,040
Is it considered one?

187
00:19:00,000 --> 00:19:01,520
Let's continue, Nakhun.

188
00:19:01,600 --> 00:19:05,120
What are the alveolar consonants?

189
00:19:05,200 --> 00:19:07,720
Made with the tongue
near the alveolar ridge.

190
00:19:08,640 --> 00:19:09,480
Such as

191
00:19:10,200 --> 00:19:14,280
S, Z, L,

192
00:19:14,360 --> 00:19:17,600
N, D, and

193
00:19:17,680 --> 00:19:18,680
-T.
-Yes, Pun?

194
00:19:18,760 --> 00:19:21,840
So you've given me a nickname now?

195
00:19:21,920 --> 00:19:23,480
Starting to fall for me, right?

196
00:19:24,160 --> 00:19:25,120
He didn't call you.

197
00:19:25,200 --> 00:19:26,560
He's talking to me.

198
00:19:30,000 --> 00:19:32,520
If I write it like this in IPA,

199
00:19:32,600 --> 00:19:33,560
can you read it?

200
00:19:34,520 --> 00:19:35,480
Here it is.

201
00:19:37,240 --> 00:19:39,640
I LIKE YOU, YOU KNOW?

202
00:19:44,280 --> 00:19:46,040
Thee.
My lips are parched.

203
00:19:46,120 --> 00:19:47,720
Yes, Pun.

204
00:19:49,000 --> 00:19:50,120
A cup of pure matcha,

205
00:19:50,200 --> 00:19:51,080
no sugar!

206
00:19:52,280 --> 00:19:55,480
Thee always clings to Pun.

207
00:19:55,560 --> 00:19:57,440
Like a puppy following a pretty face.

208
00:19:58,200 --> 00:19:59,600
His mindset is this:

209
00:19:59,680 --> 00:20:02,520
"Constant dripping wears away the stone."

210
00:20:03,880 --> 00:20:05,920
However, he's not wearing him down at all.

211
00:20:06,920 --> 00:20:07,760
Not at all.

212
00:20:08,960 --> 00:20:12,960
I never imagined that we should sit
together, sharing laughter once more,

213
00:20:13,480 --> 00:20:16,480
even though I have not
the slightest inkling of what you said.

214
00:20:20,920 --> 00:20:22,040
But…

215
00:20:22,120 --> 00:20:23,440
I just want to say

216
00:20:24,360 --> 00:20:26,080
he doesn't despises you or anything.

217
00:20:29,520 --> 00:20:31,880
Otherwise, he wouldn't let you
follow him around.

218
00:20:33,840 --> 00:20:36,160
Maybe he's just shy,

219
00:20:37,280 --> 00:20:38,280
or maybe

220
00:20:39,440 --> 00:20:41,600
in this day and age it's not acceptable…

221
00:20:42,240 --> 00:20:45,320
That's why he can't accept your love.

222
00:20:46,960 --> 00:20:48,520
Come now!

223
00:20:48,600 --> 00:20:49,600
I am a man.

224
00:20:49,680 --> 00:20:51,760
I can't give my heart
to one such as myself.

225
00:20:54,720 --> 00:20:55,720
That's fine.

226
00:20:56,240 --> 00:20:57,080
I can tell.

227
00:21:10,680 --> 00:21:13,160
Kaew…

228
00:21:15,320 --> 00:21:18,800
Phop isn't taken?

229
00:21:19,440 --> 00:21:22,120
I mean, he has not yet taken a spouse?

230
00:21:26,840 --> 00:21:29,040
Or do you think

231
00:21:30,240 --> 00:21:31,440
he likes men,

232
00:21:32,760 --> 00:21:33,960
like you do?

233
00:21:34,800 --> 00:21:36,560
Klao!

234
00:21:37,360 --> 00:21:40,720
You must not
speak of him so before others.

235
00:21:44,800 --> 00:21:46,480
So…

236
00:21:47,400 --> 00:21:48,960
he's into men?

237
00:21:56,480 --> 00:21:57,480
That I do not know.

238
00:21:59,080 --> 00:22:01,000
As the rumors go,

239
00:22:01,080 --> 00:22:02,360
Lord Phop

240
00:22:02,440 --> 00:22:03,840
resembles a war elephant

241
00:22:03,920 --> 00:22:06,320
whose strength
is spent before the first strike.

242
00:22:08,720 --> 00:22:09,880
A flame without a spark.

243
00:22:10,760 --> 00:22:12,080
A flag that won't fly.

244
00:22:12,480 --> 00:22:13,840
A dull sword.

245
00:22:13,920 --> 00:22:15,240
Noodles without broth.

246
00:22:15,320 --> 00:22:16,320
A silent songbird.

247
00:22:16,400 --> 00:22:17,280
A man of no vigor.

248
00:22:17,360 --> 00:22:18,920
That's enough.

249
00:22:22,000 --> 00:22:22,840
Phop…

250
00:22:23,520 --> 00:22:25,920
Despite looking that strong,

251
00:22:26,000 --> 00:22:29,400
his little guy doesn't work?

252
00:22:31,680 --> 00:22:32,760
You mean his brother?

253
00:22:33,880 --> 00:22:35,920
He is yet too small.

254
00:22:36,000 --> 00:22:37,200
He can do no true work.

255
00:22:38,840 --> 00:22:40,960
His is too small?

256
00:22:45,120 --> 00:22:46,640
Too small.

257
00:22:48,240 --> 00:22:50,400
His is small.

258
00:22:51,160 --> 00:22:52,000
Klao!

259
00:22:58,520 --> 00:22:59,520
Klao,

260
00:23:01,440 --> 00:23:03,080
I wish to see Phichit's swordplay.

261
00:23:05,120 --> 00:23:06,760
Pray, let me see your art.

262
00:23:29,800 --> 00:23:30,640
Master Klao.

263
00:23:30,720 --> 00:23:32,120
-Klao.
-Klao?

264
00:23:32,720 --> 00:23:33,560
Klao?

265
00:23:35,440 --> 00:23:37,160
-Klao!
-Klao.

266
00:23:37,240 --> 00:23:38,680
Master Klao.

267
00:23:38,760 --> 00:23:40,400
Master Klao!

268
00:23:40,480 --> 00:23:42,600
Fetch him the herbal remedy at once.

269
00:23:46,280 --> 00:23:47,400
The Buddha, the Dhamma…

270
00:23:47,480 --> 00:23:48,920
What ails Master now?

271
00:23:49,000 --> 00:23:50,640
Physician, lend us your cure.

272
00:23:55,240 --> 00:23:56,720
His vitals seem stable.

273
00:23:56,800 --> 00:23:59,600
He must be brought to my manor
for closer examination.

274
00:24:05,440 --> 00:24:06,520
Master Klao.

275
00:24:11,360 --> 00:24:13,400
I'm fine.

276
00:24:14,320 --> 00:24:15,360
I'm just a bit faint.

277
00:24:16,880 --> 00:24:18,600
I need to get some rest.

278
00:24:19,680 --> 00:24:20,960
Wait for me, Master.

279
00:24:36,160 --> 00:24:38,320
Physician, I pray you to follow him.

280
00:24:39,600 --> 00:24:42,400
It was but fleeting.
He now strides so effortlessly.

281
00:24:42,480 --> 00:24:43,560
No cause for concern.

282
00:24:44,200 --> 00:24:47,240
I suspect he feigned illness
to avoid swordplay.

283
00:24:47,320 --> 00:24:48,680
However, I believe

284
00:24:48,760 --> 00:24:51,200
it would be best to conduct
a thorough examination.

285
00:24:51,280 --> 00:24:52,640
Why such concern?

286
00:24:52,720 --> 00:24:53,960
His condition is sound.

287
00:24:55,440 --> 00:24:58,440
When you were laughing with him,
he appeared perfectly content,

288
00:24:58,520 --> 00:24:59,880
without a trace of illness.

289
00:24:59,960 --> 00:25:01,840
When have I made such jests?

290
00:25:01,920 --> 00:25:03,720
Throughout the sparring.

291
00:25:04,400 --> 00:25:05,880
Take up the blade yourself,

292
00:25:05,960 --> 00:25:08,200
that you may safeguard
your wife and children.

293
00:25:09,640 --> 00:25:12,560
I have never harbored any desire
for a wife or children.

294
00:25:19,160 --> 00:25:20,400
What is wrong with him?

295
00:25:24,040 --> 00:25:26,640
Are you merely feigning ignorance?

296
00:25:27,800 --> 00:25:30,160
The feelings between you and Dear Kaew

297
00:25:31,120 --> 00:25:32,320
are plain as day.

298
00:25:34,600 --> 00:25:35,960
Do not seek to conceal them.

299
00:25:37,320 --> 00:25:40,240
I harbor no feelings for him whatsoever,
only annoyance.

300
00:25:41,520 --> 00:25:42,520
My good Physician,

301
00:25:43,960 --> 00:25:46,560
we cannot know for how long
those who stand beside us

302
00:25:46,640 --> 00:25:48,560
shall remain.

303
00:25:49,240 --> 00:25:52,240
The morrow might bring a parting
we never foresaw.

304
00:25:54,840 --> 00:25:58,040
Once before, I nearly lost
all that I held dear.

305
00:25:59,760 --> 00:26:01,960
I know too well the agony it brings.

306
00:26:03,880 --> 00:26:05,680
May such sorrow never strike again.

307
00:26:08,080 --> 00:26:09,680
Neither upon myself

308
00:26:11,320 --> 00:26:12,680
nor upon my friend.

309
00:27:00,280 --> 00:27:01,840
<i>Don't get sidetracked.</i>

310
00:27:02,560 --> 00:27:04,040
<i>Continue the mission.</i>

311
00:27:06,680 --> 00:27:08,480
<i>Klao was killed.</i>

312
00:27:10,080 --> 00:27:12,160
<i>This might be the real mission.</i>

313
00:27:12,800 --> 00:27:14,320
<i>Find out who killed Klao?</i>

314
00:27:27,960 --> 00:27:29,680
Mother, Lady Varna,

315
00:27:29,760 --> 00:27:31,760
where did you find such blossoms?

316
00:27:31,840 --> 00:27:33,240
The fragrance fills the air.

317
00:27:34,200 --> 00:27:35,560
I have only just learned of

318
00:27:35,640 --> 00:27:39,600
Lady Varna's renowned skill
in the art of traditional potpourri.

319
00:27:39,680 --> 00:27:42,920
Her craft once served
the High Lord of Lopburi himself.

320
00:27:44,920 --> 00:27:48,000
The craft of perfumery
demands the utmost meticulousness.

321
00:27:48,840 --> 00:27:50,880
Your skill must be of the finest order.

322
00:27:52,440 --> 00:27:54,880
You are most kind with your words,
my Lord.

323
00:27:56,920 --> 00:27:58,720
I was charmed by the fragrance,

324
00:27:58,800 --> 00:28:00,560
so I bade her craft more for us.

325
00:28:00,640 --> 00:28:04,080
We shall soon craft a fragrance
for your pleasure, Phop.

326
00:28:04,160 --> 00:28:06,720
Kindly join me and choose the scent.

327
00:28:06,800 --> 00:28:08,200
I leave the choice to you.

328
00:28:08,280 --> 00:28:10,280
Having just practiced with the blade,

329
00:28:10,360 --> 00:28:12,560
I must wash

330
00:28:12,640 --> 00:28:14,800
before attending to my duties.

331
00:28:20,640 --> 00:28:24,280
It seems he cares little for me,
does he not?

332
00:28:26,920 --> 00:28:28,800
Do not speak thus, Lady Varna.

333
00:28:29,600 --> 00:28:30,960
Who could fail to admire one

334
00:28:31,040 --> 00:28:33,640
so fair and accomplished as you?

335
00:28:34,600 --> 00:28:36,080
I believe

336
00:28:36,160 --> 00:28:39,160
he is merely indifferent
to such trifling matters.

337
00:28:41,520 --> 00:28:42,480
Yes, my Lady.

338
00:28:58,680 --> 00:29:01,360
For all his stern demeanor,

339
00:29:01,920 --> 00:29:05,040
the truth is that
Phop is merely a bashful soul.

340
00:29:06,920 --> 00:29:10,080
Pray, do make an effort to visit
our manor more often, Lady Varna.

341
00:29:10,160 --> 00:29:11,800
We shall become better acquainted.

342
00:29:13,160 --> 00:29:14,400
But…

343
00:29:14,480 --> 00:29:16,760
would such a thing be seemly, my Lady?

344
00:29:18,080 --> 00:29:19,480
Of course.

345
00:29:20,240 --> 00:29:22,360
Should anyone inquire,

346
00:29:22,440 --> 00:29:25,360
say I summoned you to teach me perfumery.

347
00:29:26,160 --> 00:29:28,240
And should there be any malicious gossip,

348
00:29:28,320 --> 00:29:31,400
inform me at once.
I shall deal with it accordingly.

349
00:29:31,480 --> 00:29:34,960
Then I am most willing, my Lady.

350
00:29:46,400 --> 00:29:47,280
Aunt.

351
00:29:48,240 --> 00:29:49,240
Lady Varna.

352
00:29:49,960 --> 00:29:52,600
Can you teach me how to make potpourri?

353
00:30:10,120 --> 00:30:11,960
This is rather a surprise.

354
00:30:13,000 --> 00:30:14,920
I never once imagined

355
00:30:15,000 --> 00:30:18,360
you would take an interest in
such domestic crafts, Dear Klao.

356
00:30:18,440 --> 00:30:20,880
I thought you favored your books.

357
00:30:21,680 --> 00:30:22,880
Well…

358
00:30:22,960 --> 00:30:25,360
I want to make myself useful,
given a chance.

359
00:30:26,480 --> 00:30:29,800
Perhaps I might further
endear myself to you.

360
00:30:29,880 --> 00:30:31,000
My!

361
00:30:32,400 --> 00:30:36,160
My heart is already
so full of fondness for you, Dear Klao.

362
00:30:36,240 --> 00:30:38,320
Oh, you…

363
00:30:43,480 --> 00:30:46,120
Does your stomach no longer trouble you?

364
00:30:49,800 --> 00:30:52,240
It has subsided, Phop.

365
00:30:52,320 --> 00:30:55,200
That's why I'm out here with Aunt.

366
00:30:59,480 --> 00:31:01,520
What a relief.

367
00:31:02,160 --> 00:31:04,240
Then I must take leave for patrol.

368
00:31:07,440 --> 00:31:08,680
Understood.

369
00:31:11,080 --> 00:31:13,000
I must bid you farewell for now, Mother.

370
00:31:14,240 --> 00:31:15,360
Lady Varna.

371
00:31:28,320 --> 00:31:30,040
What's next,

372
00:31:30,680 --> 00:31:32,000
Lady Varna?

373
00:31:34,800 --> 00:31:36,680
It is done this way, Klao.

374
00:31:57,560 --> 00:31:59,760
<i>Yes! He's finally gone.</i>

375
00:32:08,520 --> 00:32:12,280
The flowers Phop favors
are nowhere to be found here.

376
00:32:15,080 --> 00:32:17,320
But Aunt said

377
00:32:17,400 --> 00:32:20,480
he does not favor such trifling matters.

378
00:32:22,280 --> 00:32:24,400
How come?

379
00:32:24,480 --> 00:32:29,840
Phop just asked me
to fetch him flowers by the manor

380
00:32:30,680 --> 00:32:32,320
and bring them to his room.

381
00:32:33,040 --> 00:32:36,600
Their fragrance filled the air.

382
00:32:45,720 --> 00:32:48,160
With that said,

383
00:32:48,240 --> 00:32:52,200
let me pick some more flowers for him.

384
00:33:03,800 --> 00:33:07,680
<i>Yes, I've finally made it out!</i>
<i>My plan is working.</i>

385
00:33:07,760 --> 00:33:10,240
<i>Wait for Phop to go on patrol,</i>
<i>sneak to the market,</i>

386
00:33:10,320 --> 00:33:12,760
<i>and return before he catches me!</i>

387
00:33:12,840 --> 00:33:15,360
<i>Let's complete the mission</i>
<i>and return home!</i>

388
00:33:15,440 --> 00:33:17,600
<i>I refuse to be stuck here</i>
<i>just to get married.</i>

389
00:33:28,960 --> 00:33:30,240
Kong!

390
00:33:30,320 --> 00:33:32,000
What are you doing here?

391
00:33:36,080 --> 00:33:39,240
And what of you, Master?
What brings you to this place?

392
00:33:39,320 --> 00:33:41,840
Might you be going to that place?

393
00:33:41,920 --> 00:33:43,400
"That place"?

394
00:33:44,440 --> 00:33:45,280
What do you mean?

395
00:33:45,360 --> 00:33:47,920
There is no need to keep
such secrets from me, Master.

396
00:33:48,680 --> 00:33:50,680
We both know you visit that place,

397
00:33:52,400 --> 00:33:56,000
the House of Pleasure
at the farthest end of the market.

398
00:33:57,240 --> 00:34:00,120
<i>"The House of Pleasure"? A brothel?</i>

399
00:34:00,200 --> 00:34:03,480
<i>Klao often went to the market</i>
<i>for this place?</i>

400
00:34:03,560 --> 00:34:06,200
Master Klao, allow me to accompany you.

401
00:34:09,960 --> 00:34:11,360
I beg of you, Master.

402
00:34:19,560 --> 00:34:20,400
Sure thing.

403
00:34:20,920 --> 00:34:21,760
Let's go.

404
00:34:22,600 --> 00:34:23,440
Yes!

405
00:34:34,800 --> 00:34:35,760
Let's go, shall we?

406
00:34:35,840 --> 00:34:36,920
Yes, Master Klao…

407
00:34:43,880 --> 00:34:44,719
All right!

408
00:34:46,920 --> 00:34:49,159
Master Klao, I am unable to swim.

409
00:34:49,800 --> 00:34:51,080
It's fine.

410
00:34:51,159 --> 00:34:52,800
Swim after my boat, okay?

411
00:34:54,400 --> 00:34:55,280
Master…

412
00:35:06,800 --> 00:35:08,320
Be wary.

413
00:35:08,400 --> 00:35:10,320
Thank you.

414
00:35:18,120 --> 00:35:19,520
<i>A multicultural market!</i>

415
00:35:19,600 --> 00:35:23,320
<i>Feels like the ones in Khaosan Road,</i>
<i>Pattaya, and Patpong.</i>

416
00:35:23,400 --> 00:35:26,120
<i>No wonder Klao loved coming to this place.</i>

417
00:35:26,880 --> 00:35:28,440
I'm sorry, sir.

418
00:35:28,520 --> 00:35:29,680
Excuse me.

419
00:35:31,080 --> 00:35:32,080
This place…

420
00:35:32,720 --> 00:35:34,040
What is this market called?

421
00:35:34,960 --> 00:35:36,200
It is a canal market.

422
00:35:39,120 --> 00:35:41,280
You must have
arrived from the countryside.

423
00:35:50,400 --> 00:35:53,520
<i>Okay, I'm at the right place,</i>

424
00:35:53,600 --> 00:35:54,840
<i>but where's the brothel?</i>

425
00:35:56,600 --> 00:35:58,760
<i>I hope Kong was just talking nonsense.</i>

426
00:35:58,840 --> 00:36:01,040
<i>Klao was heartbroken</i>
<i>over his father's affair.</i>

427
00:36:01,120 --> 00:36:03,240
<i>He probably didn't</i>
<i>enjoy the brothel, did he?</i>

428
00:36:12,080 --> 00:36:14,680
The sweets remain untouched.
He was not in the kitchen.

429
00:36:15,480 --> 00:36:17,160
-Not in his bed!
-Not in the garden!

430
00:36:18,200 --> 00:36:20,720
He was nowhere to be found.

431
00:36:21,720 --> 00:36:22,840
How utterly dim-witted!

432
00:36:22,920 --> 00:36:24,600
You are a lifetime's regret.

433
00:36:24,680 --> 00:36:25,880
Regret, I say!

434
00:36:25,960 --> 00:36:28,720
The cane shall leave your back
like a tiger's pelt!

435
00:36:28,800 --> 00:36:30,600
I've no wish to share the punishment.

436
00:36:30,680 --> 00:36:33,600
-You fool. What an utter fool.
-Sai! What have I done wrong?

437
00:36:33,680 --> 00:36:34,880
I could not find him.

438
00:36:34,960 --> 00:36:36,080
Nor could I!

439
00:36:36,160 --> 00:36:37,760
Are you in search of Master Klao?

440
00:36:41,040 --> 00:36:43,320
Do you know Master's whereabouts?

441
00:36:55,000 --> 00:36:58,080
The House of Pleasure.

442
00:37:01,480 --> 00:37:02,800
Good heavens!

443
00:37:03,720 --> 00:37:04,920
All is ruined!

444
00:37:14,280 --> 00:37:15,240
A delightful taste.

445
00:37:16,000 --> 00:37:18,040
-Sweet and wonderful.
-You.

446
00:37:18,120 --> 00:37:19,080
You there.

447
00:37:22,280 --> 00:37:23,320
You!

448
00:37:24,200 --> 00:37:26,400
Are you talking to me?

449
00:37:37,120 --> 00:37:38,080
Yes.

450
00:37:38,160 --> 00:37:39,280
I am talking to you,

451
00:37:40,560 --> 00:37:41,520
Master Klao.

452
00:37:43,120 --> 00:37:44,680
Where have you been?

453
00:37:45,640 --> 00:37:51,240
I was led to believe your heart
had strayed to another favored place.

454
00:37:52,520 --> 00:37:55,160
This way, this way.

455
00:37:55,240 --> 00:37:57,920
If you would, this way.

456
00:38:01,080 --> 00:38:02,040
Hey!

457
00:38:02,120 --> 00:38:04,280
Hey! Pray, help me!

458
00:38:06,480 --> 00:38:07,320
Too high.

459
00:38:08,640 --> 00:38:10,120
Oh, my.

460
00:38:14,760 --> 00:38:15,640
Master Klao.

461
00:38:15,720 --> 00:38:17,520
Today…

462
00:38:17,600 --> 00:38:20,800
We have the Seven-Headed,
Three-Clawed Dragon herbal liquor.

463
00:38:20,880 --> 00:38:23,160
It relieves body pain

464
00:38:23,240 --> 00:38:26,160
and helps you sleep well.

465
00:38:26,240 --> 00:38:28,200
Goodness. Were you to taste this,

466
00:38:28,280 --> 00:38:31,160
its potency would far surpass
even that of the Dragon…

467
00:38:31,240 --> 00:38:34,000
The Dragon… That one…

468
00:38:34,080 --> 00:38:37,280
The Dragon Horse, Seared by Fire.

469
00:38:43,960 --> 00:38:44,960
Here.

470
00:38:48,240 --> 00:38:49,160
Here it is.

471
00:38:51,000 --> 00:38:52,000
I'd rather not.

472
00:38:52,080 --> 00:38:54,880
I have no taste for herbal liquor.

473
00:38:56,640 --> 00:38:58,880
No taste for herbal liquor?

474
00:38:58,960 --> 00:39:01,120
Last time you had half a jar.

475
00:39:01,200 --> 00:39:04,040
If you did,
I daresay you'd take the whole pot.

476
00:39:07,120 --> 00:39:11,960
Well, I prefer…
<i>Soju!</i>

477
00:39:13,080 --> 00:39:14,240
<i>Jjan!</i>

478
00:39:24,280 --> 00:39:25,280
<i>"Jjan"?</i>

479
00:39:28,680 --> 00:39:29,680
Like "jangle"?

480
00:39:31,720 --> 00:39:34,200
So the rumor that

481
00:39:34,800 --> 00:39:37,160
Master Klao has gone mad

482
00:39:37,240 --> 00:39:38,640
is true?

483
00:41:01,080 --> 00:41:03,440
You are truly gifted, my Lord.

484
00:41:03,520 --> 00:41:05,200
You speak the tongue of the Farang.

485
00:41:07,600 --> 00:41:09,120
I owe it to my esteemed mentor.

486
00:41:10,760 --> 00:41:13,120
I mean no intrusion, my Lord,

487
00:41:13,200 --> 00:41:16,920
yet I cannot help but notice
your cheerful disposition today.

488
00:41:17,000 --> 00:41:19,640
A certain someone has graced my manor

489
00:41:19,720 --> 00:41:22,480
with the scent of potpourri,
awaiting my return.

490
00:41:31,840 --> 00:41:33,360
Are you intrigued?

491
00:41:34,360 --> 00:41:38,360
<i>That was close. So, do people here</i>
<i>misunderstand Klao or not?</i>

492
00:41:38,440 --> 00:41:40,400
<i>I thought there was drama with his dad,</i>

493
00:41:40,480 --> 00:41:44,120
<i>but no, he's simply a sad bad boy.</i>

494
00:41:46,840 --> 00:41:49,320
<i>So his visit to the brothel means…</i>

495
00:41:50,560 --> 00:41:53,000
<i>Do I really have to</i>
<i>learn the truth there myself?</i>

496
00:41:56,960 --> 00:41:58,520
Excuse me.

497
00:41:59,480 --> 00:42:03,160
Is this The House…

498
00:42:03,240 --> 00:42:05,000
Master Klao!

499
00:42:05,760 --> 00:42:07,520
Where have you been these many days?

500
00:42:07,600 --> 00:42:09,720
Pim speaks your name all day.

501
00:42:10,640 --> 00:42:12,280
Come, let us depart, Master Klao.

502
00:42:12,360 --> 00:42:13,640
Pim?

503
00:42:13,720 --> 00:42:15,440
Mother!

504
00:42:15,520 --> 00:42:17,520
Master Klao has returned!

505
00:42:17,600 --> 00:42:20,960
I'm not here to enjoy myself, by the way.

506
00:42:21,640 --> 00:42:23,920
I'm not here to have a good time, okay?

507
00:42:24,000 --> 00:42:25,960
I'm not here to have fun, okay?

508
00:43:08,800 --> 00:43:10,480
Your absence has been long indeed.

509
00:43:11,840 --> 00:43:15,240
A very warm welcome back to
the Pavilion of Affection, Master.

510
00:43:17,400 --> 00:43:19,760
Upon your return,

511
00:43:19,840 --> 00:43:21,640
you seem somewhat troubled, Master.

512
00:43:21,720 --> 00:43:24,480
Pray, let the maidens see to your comfort

513
00:43:24,560 --> 00:43:26,840
and ease your worries.

514
00:43:26,920 --> 00:43:28,520
This way, Master.

515
00:43:28,600 --> 00:43:32,400
Long has your absence been, Master Klao.
We've missed you dearly.

516
00:43:32,480 --> 00:43:33,720
It is so, Master.

517
00:43:33,800 --> 00:43:35,720
Pim is occupied today,

518
00:43:35,800 --> 00:43:38,440
so I shall attend to
your comfort myself, Master.

519
00:43:38,520 --> 00:43:39,960
Perhaps I can attend to you.

520
00:43:40,040 --> 00:43:41,280
Heavens, you lot!

521
00:43:41,360 --> 00:43:43,960
He has but returned. Cease your dallying.

522
00:43:46,480 --> 00:43:47,680
Master Klao,

523
00:43:47,760 --> 00:43:50,120
Pray, come into the receiving room.

524
00:43:50,200 --> 00:43:52,160
-Let us make our way.
-I…

525
00:43:53,240 --> 00:43:55,680
I shall go
and fetch Pim for you presently, Master.

526
00:43:57,160 --> 00:43:58,160
Let us be on our way.

527
00:44:09,440 --> 00:44:10,760
<i>Too late to turn back?</i>

528
00:44:10,840 --> 00:44:13,960
<i>But I won't get any clues if I do, right?</i>

529
00:44:14,040 --> 00:44:17,800
<i>I don't dislike you guys or anything, but…</i>

530
00:44:19,400 --> 00:44:22,640
<i>Phop, help me!</i>

531
00:44:34,200 --> 00:44:36,280
Has Dear Klao finished the potpourri?

532
00:44:41,120 --> 00:44:42,600
My Lord,

533
00:44:44,960 --> 00:44:46,480
the fault is mine alone.

534
00:45:02,720 --> 00:45:04,080
Hi, Pim.

535
00:45:04,920 --> 00:45:07,400
Long time no see.

536
00:45:07,480 --> 00:45:08,560
I miss you.

537
00:45:08,640 --> 00:45:13,680
By the way, when was the last time we met?

538
00:45:13,760 --> 00:45:16,320
And what did I do?

539
00:45:17,480 --> 00:45:18,640
I am…

540
00:45:20,240 --> 00:45:21,640
Puang, Master.

541
00:45:46,840 --> 00:45:48,960
Truly, it has been so long

542
00:45:50,040 --> 00:45:52,160
that you have forgotten my face.

543
00:46:22,760 --> 00:46:24,080
Indeed,

544
00:46:25,120 --> 00:46:27,320
a man's tongue is woven of deceit.

545
00:47:07,800 --> 00:47:09,560
Shall we remain quiet then?

546
00:47:11,240 --> 00:47:14,120
We may as well
wait till the candles melt away.

547
00:47:14,200 --> 00:47:15,720
For, regardless…

548
00:47:19,160 --> 00:47:21,600
I remain a stranger in your memories.

549
00:47:28,000 --> 00:47:31,520
Well, I…

550
00:47:31,600 --> 00:47:32,840
I've lost my memory.

551
00:47:33,600 --> 00:47:34,440
Truly?

552
00:47:35,360 --> 00:47:36,200
Truly.

553
00:47:36,280 --> 00:47:37,520
Certainly?

554
00:47:37,600 --> 00:47:38,920
Certainly.

555
00:47:39,000 --> 00:47:40,160
For what reason

556
00:47:40,760 --> 00:47:43,160
do you neglect your treatment

557
00:47:43,240 --> 00:47:45,200
to come to me instead, Master Klao?

558
00:47:45,840 --> 00:47:47,040
That's a very good point.

559
00:47:47,120 --> 00:47:49,840
I'm here to see thee…

560
00:47:49,920 --> 00:47:50,880
I mean, you…

561
00:47:52,560 --> 00:47:53,800
Yeah, you…

562
00:47:53,880 --> 00:47:54,720
Why am I here?

563
00:47:56,240 --> 00:47:57,600
Why did I come here?

564
00:48:01,000 --> 00:48:02,280
Indeed, why?

565
00:48:02,920 --> 00:48:03,920
This is

566
00:48:06,000 --> 00:48:07,680
the House of Pleasure.

567
00:48:12,440 --> 00:48:14,560
What brings

568
00:48:15,960 --> 00:48:17,680
a gentleman such as yourself

569
00:48:17,760 --> 00:48:19,800
to a place like this, Master Klao?

570
00:48:55,280 --> 00:48:57,240
<i>No… Please, no…</i>

571
00:49:05,440 --> 00:49:08,200
You have quite forgotten me.

572
00:49:13,440 --> 00:49:14,800
We…

573
00:49:18,120 --> 00:49:21,120
have never engaged in such conduct.

574
00:49:29,120 --> 00:49:31,280
Your only intent was to sit with me

575
00:49:33,920 --> 00:49:35,160
and visit me.

576
00:49:37,040 --> 00:49:38,320
I…

577
00:49:39,560 --> 00:49:42,360
I was only here to talk to you?

578
00:49:43,160 --> 00:49:44,160
Indeed.

579
00:49:45,960 --> 00:49:47,400
Simply to speak with me.

580
00:49:49,800 --> 00:49:51,920
Never once have you
overstepped your bounds.

581
00:49:57,760 --> 00:49:58,760
Why?

582
00:50:00,440 --> 00:50:01,400
And…

583
00:50:02,520 --> 00:50:05,760
how did we get to know each other?

584
00:50:06,480 --> 00:50:09,280
I wasn't here to have fun?

585
00:50:12,560 --> 00:50:13,840
No, Master.

586
00:50:15,480 --> 00:50:17,160
You simply held me in fond regard

587
00:50:18,960 --> 00:50:20,360
because…

588
00:50:21,000 --> 00:50:23,280
upon our very first encounter,

589
00:50:24,440 --> 00:50:26,160
I was…

590
00:50:26,240 --> 00:50:28,480
Where on earth is Pim?

591
00:50:29,040 --> 00:50:29,880
Speak!

592
00:50:29,960 --> 00:50:30,800
Well…

593
00:50:46,040 --> 00:50:47,160
So it is you, Klao.

594
00:50:47,240 --> 00:50:48,840
You snatched her from me.

595
00:50:49,480 --> 00:50:51,160
You knew I had claimed her,

596
00:50:51,240 --> 00:50:53,400
yet you dared slight me thus.

597
00:50:53,480 --> 00:50:54,720
So what of it?

598
00:50:54,800 --> 00:50:56,360
I've let no one claim me.

599
00:50:56,920 --> 00:50:59,280
As Master Klao reached me first,

600
00:50:59,360 --> 00:51:01,040
my presence is his.

601
00:51:02,040 --> 00:51:03,960
-Let us return inside.
-You shall not go!

602
00:51:05,880 --> 00:51:08,760
Curse you, Sopha. I told you!
Pim is mine, and mine alone.

603
00:51:08,840 --> 00:51:10,760
How dare you let anyone else have her!

604
00:51:11,280 --> 00:51:12,520
You…

605
00:51:12,600 --> 00:51:14,880
You said you'd go to the outer cities.

606
00:51:17,800 --> 00:51:19,360
Yet I have returned, have I not?

607
00:51:21,840 --> 00:51:23,400
Hand over Pim.

608
00:51:24,560 --> 00:51:25,400
Now.

609
00:51:26,000 --> 00:51:27,200
No.

610
00:51:28,320 --> 00:51:29,240
Pim.

611
00:51:30,880 --> 00:51:32,480
Come to me this instant!

612
00:51:32,560 --> 00:51:33,520
Be quick!

613
00:51:35,960 --> 00:51:36,840
Damn you!

614
00:51:38,400 --> 00:51:39,960
Stay out of this!

615
00:51:47,360 --> 00:51:49,320
Do you have a death wish, Klao?

616
00:51:49,400 --> 00:51:50,640
Cease this at once!

617
00:51:58,600 --> 00:51:59,480
Dear Klao.

618
00:52:00,720 --> 00:52:02,200
For what purpose came you here?

619
00:52:06,440 --> 00:52:07,400
I…

620
00:52:07,480 --> 00:52:08,360
Sopha,

621
00:52:08,880 --> 00:52:10,080
see them inside.

622
00:52:10,160 --> 00:52:11,360
Yes, my Lord.

623
00:52:11,440 --> 00:52:13,040
Make haste.

624
00:52:14,480 --> 00:52:15,320
Make haste.

625
00:52:18,640 --> 00:52:19,480
Now!

626
00:52:21,160 --> 00:52:22,040
Come.

627
00:52:36,600 --> 00:52:37,520
Cherd.

628
00:52:37,600 --> 00:52:39,040
Come with me at once.

629
00:52:41,160 --> 00:52:42,160
Dear Klao,

630
00:52:42,680 --> 00:52:43,680
return to your manor,

631
00:52:44,080 --> 00:52:45,080
lest Lord Phop worry.

632
00:52:47,440 --> 00:52:49,200
If Klao stays, so shall I.

633
00:52:49,280 --> 00:52:50,160
Cherd.

634
00:52:55,760 --> 00:52:57,160
Stay here then.

635
00:53:24,480 --> 00:53:27,640
<i>Damn, Phop's probably already</i>
<i>back at the manor!</i>

636
00:53:32,160 --> 00:53:34,160
<i>Why should I be afraid he's upset with me?</i>

637
00:53:34,240 --> 00:53:36,920
<i>I'll hit back if he gets upset.</i>

638
00:53:45,400 --> 00:53:49,920
<i>But it's getting dark,</i>
<i>so I have no choice but to head back.</i>

639
00:53:58,200 --> 00:54:00,640
-We must take shelter.
-Make haste.

640
00:54:20,040 --> 00:54:21,280
Take shelter with me.

641
00:54:21,360 --> 00:54:23,400
Child, come here.

642
00:54:25,160 --> 00:54:26,360
It's okay. I'm fine.

643
00:54:29,000 --> 00:54:30,840
You may fall ill, child.

644
00:54:30,920 --> 00:54:32,640
-Thank you.
-Pray don't fall ill.

645
00:54:54,640 --> 00:54:56,800
I can wait no longer.

646
00:54:58,200 --> 00:55:00,480
Kong, ready the vessel.

647
00:55:04,960 --> 00:55:06,040
Phop,

648
00:55:06,120 --> 00:55:08,120
the rain is falling.

649
00:55:08,200 --> 00:55:10,080
To set sail now would be perilous.

650
00:55:10,960 --> 00:55:14,680
He lacks experience in handling a boat.
Would that not be a far greater risk?

651
00:55:29,880 --> 00:55:33,240
<i>By now, Phop must be terribly worried.</i>

652
00:55:43,320 --> 00:55:44,440
Hold on a second.

653
00:55:44,520 --> 00:55:45,920
Uncle.

654
00:55:46,600 --> 00:55:47,520
Uncle!

655
00:55:49,640 --> 00:55:50,480
Uncle!

656
00:55:52,680 --> 00:55:53,560
Uncle.

657
00:55:55,480 --> 00:55:56,520
I mean, sir…

658
00:55:57,880 --> 00:56:00,560
I can't handle a boat very well.

659
00:56:01,520 --> 00:56:04,840
Can you escort me to my manor?

660
00:57:24,240 --> 00:57:26,280
Phop, I'm sorry.

661
00:57:26,360 --> 00:57:29,240
<i>Master Klao has been out in the sun,</i>
<i>watching over you.</i>

662
00:57:29,320 --> 00:57:31,680
<i>By evening, he began to lapse</i>
<i>into delirium.</i>

663
00:57:31,760 --> 00:57:33,280
<i>I made myself clear.</i>

664
00:57:33,360 --> 00:57:34,760
<i>I see you only as a brother.</i>

665
00:57:34,840 --> 00:57:36,440
I could never feel otherwise.

666
00:57:36,520 --> 00:57:38,360
I should not have fallen for you.

667
00:57:39,200 --> 00:57:40,040
<i>Phop!</i>

668
00:57:41,440 --> 00:57:42,840
-What?
-I had a nightmare.

669
00:57:42,920 --> 00:57:44,000
Tonight,

670
00:57:44,720 --> 00:57:46,520
might you share my bed?
